                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/GAP"} GAP
          %p
            There are many generalizations and related structures; for example the vertical categorifications of groups like
            = succeed "s," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-group"} 2-group
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoids"} groupoids
